
=== Initial config flow, walked end to end ===

-- #590 NumberSelector / advanced convention
  ok   walker refuses a NumberSelector built outside _number
  ok   walker accepts _number and _widen_to_fit
  ok   walker refuses _number that omits mode
  ok   walker refuses description={advanced: True}
  ok   production config_flow.py holds the #590 convention
